Duckietown.jl is an independent community project based on the Duckietown
simulation environment. It is not an official Duckietown product and is not
maintained by Duckietown.

Portions of this implementation are based on or derived from gym-duckietown
(https://github.com/duckietown/gym-duckietown), originally developed by the
Duckietown project (https://www.duckietown.org):

  - the lane Bezier control-point templates and the associated
    map-interpretation logic;
  - the camera constants;
  - the DB18 motor-model semantics; and
  - the reward structure, as reimplemented in Julia.

